  },
  {
   "id": "bn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 690,
   "y": 366,
   "width": 413,
   "height": 18,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100048,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700336,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why local rather than a shared cluster index",
   "originalText": "Why local rather than a shared cluster index",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 690,
   "y": 392,
   "width": 568,
   "height": 97,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100049,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700343,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A data node only ever answers questions about data it holds. A shared\nindex would add a network round trip to every read for information the\nnode could have stored locally - and would have to absorb the full\ncluster read rate, becoming a bottleneck and a shared failure domain\nfor a lookup that is intrinsically local. Keeping it local means it\nscales with node count and dies with the node it describes.",
   "originalText": "A data node only ever answers questions about data it holds. A shared\nindex would add a network round trip to every read for information the\nnode could have stored locally - and would have to absorb the full\ncluster read rate, becoming a bottleneck and a shared failure domain\nfor a lookup that is intrinsically local. Keeping it local means it\nscales with node count and dies with the node it describes.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 690,
   "y": 544,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 32,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100050,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700350,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Not a hash map in memory: it must survive restart without re-scanning\n4 GB files to rebuild offsets, and compaction needs a range scan.",
   "originalText": "Not a hash map in memory: it must survive restart without re-scanning\n4 GB files to rebuild offsets, and compaction needs a range scan.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
